          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The sample mean has $\\sigma_{\\bar{X}}=\\dfrac{6.4}{\\sqrt{64}}=\\dfrac{6.4}{8}=0.8$. Standardise:<br/>$$z=\\frac{126-124}{0.8}=\\frac{2}{0.8}=2.5$$<br/>$$P(\\bar{X}<126)=P(Z<2.5)=0.9938.$$<br/>The trap is using $\\sigma = 6.4$ instead of the standard ERROR 0.8, which would give $z=0.31$; and 0.0062 is the upper tail $P(Z>2.5)$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Trung bình mẫu có $\\sigma_{\\bar{X}}=\\dfrac{6{,}4}{\\sqrt{64}}=\\dfrac{6{,}4}{8}=0{,}8$. Chuẩn hoá:<br/>$$z=\\frac{126-124}{0{,}8}=\\frac{2}{0{,}8}=2{,}5$$<br/>$$P(\\bar{X}<126)=P(Z<2{,}5)=0{,}9938.$$<br/>Bẫy ở đây là dùng $\\sigma = 6{,}4$ thay vì SAI SỐ CHUẨN 0,8 (sẽ ra $z=0{,}31$); còn 0,0062 là đuôi trên $P(Z>2{,}5)$.</p></div>"
