          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>We will reject the alternative hypothesis $H_1: p \\ne p_0$ when __________<br/>(i) $|z_0| < z_{\\alpha/2}$<br/>(ii) $z_0 > -z_{\\alpha/2}$ or $z_0 < z_{\\alpha/2}$<br/>(iii) $p_0 > |p_{\\alpha/2}|$</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Ta sẽ BÁC BỎ giả thuyết đối $H_1: p \\ne p_0$ khi __________<br/>(i) $|z_0| < z_{\\alpha/2}$<br/>(ii) $z_0 > -z_{\\alpha/2}$ hoặc $z_0 < z_{\\alpha/2}$<br/>(iii) $p_0 > |p_{\\alpha/2}|$</p></div>",
