          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Sample proportions: $\\hat{p}_1 = 600/1200 = 0.50$, $\\hat{p}_2 = 360/800 = 0.45$. Under $H_0: p_1 = p_2$ use the POOLED proportion:<br/>$$\\hat{p}=\\frac{600+360}{1200+800}=\\frac{960}{2000}=0.48$$<br/>$$z_0=\\frac{\\hat{p}_1-\\hat{p}_2}{\\sqrt{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})\\left(\\frac{1}{n_1}+\\frac{1}{n_2}\\right)}}=\\frac{0.05}{\\sqrt{0.48(0.52)(\\frac{1}{1200}+\\frac{1}{800})}}=\\frac{0.05}{\\sqrt{0.00052}}=\\frac{0.05}{0.022804}=2.19.$$<br/>The sign is POSITIVE because sample 1 (Maricopa, 0.50) was placed first and is the larger proportion.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tỉ lệ mẫu: $\\hat{p}_1 = 600/1200 = 0{,}50$, $\\hat{p}_2 = 360/800 = 0{,}45$. Dưới $H_0: p_1 = p_2$ ta dùng tỉ lệ GỘP:<br/>$$\\hat{p}=\\frac{600+360}{1200+800}=\\frac{960}{2000}=0{,}48$$<br/>$$z_0=\\frac{\\hat{p}_1-\\hat{p}_2}{\\sqrt{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})\\left(\\frac{1}{n_1}+\\frac{1}{n_2}\\right)}}=\\frac{0{,}05}{\\sqrt{0{,}48(0{,}52)(\\frac{1}{1200}+\\frac{1}{800})}}=\\frac{0{,}05}{\\sqrt{0{,}00052}}=\\frac{0{,}05}{0{,}022804}=2{,}19.$$<br/>Dấu DƯƠNG vì mẫu 1 (Maricopa, 0,50) được đặt trước và có tỉ lệ lớn hơn.</p></div>"
