          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\bar{x}=\\frac{73+85+91}{3}=83$, $\\bar{y}=\\frac{3+8+10}{3}=7$.<br/>$$S_{xx}=(-10)^2+2^2+8^2=100+4+64=168$$<br/>$$S_{xy}=(-10)(-4)+(2)(1)+(8)(3)=40+2+24=66$$<br/>$$\\hat{\\beta}_1=\\frac{S_{xy}}{S_{xx}}=\\frac{66}{168}=0.3929$$<br/>$$\\hat{\\beta}_0=\\bar{y}-\\hat{\\beta}_1\\bar{x}=7-0.3929(83)=7-32.607=-25.607$$<br/>So $\\hat{y}=0.393x-25.607$, which is (iv). A fast sanity check: the intercept must be strongly negative, since the line passes through $(83, 7)$ with a positive slope.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\bar{x}=\\frac{73+85+91}{3}=83$, $\\bar{y}=\\frac{3+8+10}{3}=7$.<br/>$$S_{xx}=(-10)^2+2^2+8^2=100+4+64=168$$<br/>$$S_{xy}=(-10)(-4)+(2)(1)+(8)(3)=40+2+24=66$$<br/>$$\\hat{\\beta}_1=\\frac{S_{xy}}{S_{xx}}=\\frac{66}{168}=0{,}3929$$<br/>$$\\hat{\\beta}_0=\\bar{y}-\\hat{\\beta}_1\\bar{x}=7-0{,}3929(83)=7-32{,}607=-25{,}607$$<br/>Vậy $\\hat{y}=0{,}393x-25{,}607$, tức (iv). Kiểm nhanh: hệ số chặn PHẢI âm mạnh, vì đường thẳng đi qua $(83; 7)$ với hệ số góc dương.</p></div>"
